From: EglantinePS5 <Vampinity@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: up: DMA miss stats, why the front's DMA snapshot misses (EDEN_UP_DMA_MISS_STATS, log only)

DRAFT, not built. Measurement (job K2, AI draft). EDEN_UP_DMA_MISS_STATS (exact 1, live, Id
DmaMissStats, not armed); off by default. On: each FrontDmaRead is counted once, a miss by its
cause (new page, the latest compute/copy or unranged writer by method class, an overlapping noted
write, lost history); waits and validity are unchanged. 10 s line "EDEN_UP_DMA_MISS_STATS",
ending early at a gap of over 1 s (end=gap).

Reviewed draft (job K review, verdict "ready with corrections"): draft-k2-dma-miss-stats.v2.patch.
live_switch.h re-anchored after RadvOomLend; all +/- lines byte-identical.
